  birdName: Kiwi
  icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: a0bb4a1bcda85ef47af3c32a0cc104a3, type: 3}
  description: "During the day, Kiwi sells the freshest fruit to anyone who comes
    by Kiwi\u2019s fruit stand. At night, Ninja Kiwi blends the meanest smoothies
    around the block (this is totally not a reference to the game company Ninja Kiwi
    or the game Fruit Ninja). Rumor has it no one has seen Kiwi and Ninja Kiwi in
    the same room\u2026"
  offensiveAbility: "Kiwi fires a laser beam from its eyes to hit the ball, which
    automatically counts as the next action required for the ball in the rally. If
    spiking or blocking, increases the ball\u2019s speed (15s cooldown)"
  offensiveIcon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 3ef13db8c4563484bba6c89bc82c1366, type: 3}
  defensiveAbility: "Stealth Burrowing (name can be changed) - Kiwi burrows underground,
    becoming faster (thinking probably 9 speed) while also ignoring field effects.
    (Kiwi can\u2019t hit the ball while underground.) When the ability ends (button
    press or time running out), Kiwi jumps out of the ground (12s cooldown after
    coming out of the ground)"
  defensiveIcon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 73df00bf92bb9a744a057dd8d19b8a06, type: 3}
  groundSpeed: 6
  jumpForce: 7
  strength: 4
